.service) on node2 and node3 that appeared after the DNS/reboot changes.","limitations":["The cause of the newly-failed NetworkManager-wait-online.service on node2/node3 (present only in the after_executor snapshot) was not investigated by the executor or explained in available evidence; it did not appear to break DNS functionality but represents an unaddressed state change.","No evidence directly confirms whether the leftover /tmp/vyos_dns.sh from the manual troubleshooting phase was removed from node1.","Node4 (control node) restart is not part of the public task contract; its inclusion is assessed only under the independent restart-evidence protocol and does not affect task functionality scoring."]},"ttft_ms":31966,"type":"result","duration_ms":76551,"uuid":"88f2f705-5ec4-4c4e-b747-be894a867946","ttft_stream_ms":2688,"time_to_request_ms":192,"first_content_frame_ms":2689,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
